<title>USA: Apple says Q1 gross margin hits 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Apple says Q1 gross margin hits 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer Inc on Wednesday said its gross margin rose to 19 percent in its fiscal first quarter ended December 27, up from 15 percent in the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>But the gross margin fell from 22 percent in the September quarter, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Its cash position at the end of the quarter was $1.8 billion, the company said.</p>
</text>
